						110100353
					],
					"speakerTitle": "托克"
				},
				{
					"id": 110100353,
					"content": "#没错。虽然哥哥也很想陪陪托克，可毕竟工作在身，不如还是让带你来的{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTERA]}陪你吧？",
